{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 3888446200558633054,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Metadata for Python Software Packages 1.1",
      "source_hash": 45998525478376243,
      "context_hash": 17276621436332105427,
      "translation": "Python 소프트웨어 패키지를 위한 메타데이터 1.1",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Introduction",
      "source_hash": 17143975622463353612,
      "context_hash": 12757540746798737803,
      "translation": "소개",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP describes a mechanism for adding metadata to Python packages.",
      "source_hash": 3598135053096227510,
      "context_hash": 14591581790658290131,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 Python 패키지에 메타데이터를 추가하는 메커니즘을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It includes specifics of the field names, and their semantics and usage.",
      "source_hash": 1525954840275318508,
      "context_hash": 8222168336451118032,
      "translation": "필드 이름과 그 의미 및 사용법에 대한 세부 사항을 포함합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This document specifies version 1.1 of the metadata format.",
      "source_hash": 16868465162194886971,
      "context_hash": 4820362407965426556,
      "translation": "이 문서는 메타데이터 형식의 버전 1.1을 규정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Version 1.0 is specified in :pep:`241`.",
      "source_hash": 119974916950132441,
      "context_hash": 12944544968109319564,
      "translation": "버전 1.0은 :pep:`241`\\ 에 규정되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Including Metadata in Packages",
      "source_hash": 6142545026947709806,
      "context_hash": 8659229144566265868,
      "translation": "패키지에 메타데이터 포함하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Distutils ``sdist`` command will extract the metadata fields from the arguments and write them to a file in the generated zipfile or tarball.",
      "source_hash": 11748698256096564259,
      "context_hash": 18109724927910112963,
      "translation": "Distutils ``sdist`` 명령은 인자에서 메타데이터 필드를 추출하여 생성된 zipfile이나 tarball 안의 파일에 기록합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This file will be named PKG-INFO and will be placed in the top directory of the source distribution (where the README, INSTALL, and other files usually go).",
      "source_hash": 16293743844116486510,
      "context_hash": 1624631718265249549,
      "translation": "이 파일의 이름은 PKG-INFO이며, 소스 배포판의 최상위 디렉터리(README, INSTALL 및 기타 파일이 보통 위치하는 곳)에 놓입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Developers may not provide their own PKG-INFO file.",
      "source_hash": 16396589206063865964,
      "context_hash": 2465437545366363091,
      "translation": "개발자는 자신의 PKG-INFO 파일을 직접 제공할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The ``sdist`` command will, if it detects an existing PKG-INFO file, terminate with an appropriate error message.",
      "source_hash": 14294948570148425958,
      "context_hash": 17420710275723770893,
      "translation": "``sdist`` 명령은 기존 PKG-INFO 파일이 존재하는 것을 감지하면 적절한 오류 메시지와 함께 종료합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "This should prevent confusion caused by the PKG-INFO and setup.py files being out of sync.",
      "source_hash": 1233583372443590760,
      "context_hash": 6777096237021183745,
      "translation": "이는 PKG-INFO 파일과 setup.py 파일이 서로 어긋남으로 인해 발생하는 혼란을 방지해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The PKG-INFO file format is a single set of :rfc:`822` headers parseable by the rfc822.py module.",
      "source_hash": 15381925668748272876,
      "context_hash": 10496267064161293297,
      "translation": "PKG-INFO 파일 형식은 rfc822.py 모듈로 파싱할 수 있는 단일 :rfc:`822` 헤더 집합입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The field names listed in the following section are used as the header names.",
      "source_hash": 16340106231332417695,
      "context_hash": 4820224101886850290,
      "translation": "다음 절에 나열된 필드 이름들이 헤더 이름으로 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Fields",
      "source_hash": 8801550319744839382,
      "context_hash": 16260600455832068102,
      "translation": "필드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This section specifies the names and semantics of each of the supported metadata fields.",
      "source_hash": 9609715058023728548,
      "context_hash": 10995584239740163911,
      "translation": "이 절은 지원되는 각 메타데이터 필드의 이름과 의미를 규정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:50.843029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Fields marked with \"(Multiple use)\" may be specified multiple times in a single PKG-INFO file.",
      "source_hash": 13894589803829462265,
      "context_hash": 7578212817554930703,
      "translation": "\"(Multiple use)\"로 표시된 필드는 하나의 PKG-INFO 파일 안에서 여러 번 지정될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136364Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Other fields may only occur once in a PKG-INFO file.",
      "source_hash": 7059932366488618380,
      "context_hash": 7735021805528679533,
      "translation": "그 외의 필드는 하나의 PKG-INFO 파일 안에서 한 번만 나타날 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136369Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Fields marked with \"(optional)\" are not required to appear in a valid PKG-INFO file; all other fields must be present.",
      "source_hash": 11006325918550177203,
      "context_hash": 10020560256073434685,
      "translation": "\"(optional)\"로 표시된 필드는 유효한 PKG-INFO 파일에 반드시 나타나야 하는 것은 아니며, 그 외의 모든 필드는 반드시 있어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Metadata-Version",
      "source_hash": 17760411396601320070,
      "context_hash": 11836380141878450873,
      "translation": "Metadata-Version",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Version of the file format; currently \"1.0\" and \"1.1\" are the only legal values here.",
      "source_hash": 16455504032964874381,
      "context_hash": 17276435319459515173,
      "translation": "파일 형식의 버전이며, 현재는 \"1.0\"과 \"1.1\"만이 여기서 유효한 값입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 13444879640542261131,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Name",
      "source_hash": 10960610182298152005,
      "context_hash": 10407503714764737625,
      "translation": "Name",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The name of the package.",
      "source_hash": 15148163999686467216,
      "context_hash": 3816371200488287256,
      "translation": "패키지의 이름입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 1569398457601460906,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Version",
      "source_hash": 16904860506004502524,
      "context_hash": 10962229933684593768,
      "translation": "Version",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the package's version number.",
      "source_hash": 16652328162147224332,
      "context_hash": 16768564694699658738,
      "translation": "패키지의 버전 번호를 담은 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This field should be parseable by one of the Version classes (StrictVersion or LooseVersion) in the distutils.version module.",
      "source_hash": 9665887262816682611,
      "context_hash": 3325724800358037918,
      "translation": "이 필드는 distutils.version 모듈에 있는 Version 클래스(StrictVersion 또는 LooseVersion) 중 하나로 파싱 가능해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136374Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 7128288497539031403,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Platform (multiple use)",
      "source_hash": 1678610552865821649,
      "context_hash": 6385222383657322732,
      "translation": "Platform (multiple use)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A comma-separated list of platform specifications, summarizing the operating systems supported by the package which are not listed in the \"Operating System\" Trove classifiers.",
      "source_hash": 1653749982008935021,
      "context_hash": 10516207766957182598,
      "translation": "\"Operating System\" Trove 분류자에 나열되어 있지 않은, 패키지가 지원하는 운영체제를 요약한 쉼표로 구분된 플랫폼 명세 목록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136376Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "See \"Classifier\" below.",
      "source_hash": 17127046196101913533,
      "context_hash": 10678792250475869049,
      "translation": "아래의 \"Classifier\"를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:51.136376Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 6940610148102089247,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751552Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Supported-Platform (multiple use)",
      "source_hash": 13168283911413384686,
      "context_hash": 11205435554603576762,
      "translation": "Supported-Platform (다중 사용)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Binary distributions containing a PKG-INFO file will use the Supported-Platform field in their metadata to specify the OS and CPU for which the binary package was compiled.",
      "source_hash": 7184167208129077135,
      "context_hash": 17553667363158145179,
      "translation": "PKG-INFO 파일을 포함하는 바이너리 배포판은 메타데이터의 Supported-Platform 필드를 사용하여 바이너리 패키지가 컴파일된 운영체제와 CPU를 지정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The semantics of the Supported-Platform field are not specified in this PEP.",
      "source_hash": 18146839887918710374,
      "context_hash": 9837533728952736743,
      "translation": "Supported-Platform 필드의 의미론은 이 PEP에서 명시되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 4178903811549954094,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Summary",
      "source_hash": 13527386753909660859,
      "context_hash": 13666806240138781209,
      "translation": "Summary",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A one-line summary of what the package does.",
      "source_hash": 4153365739339257091,
      "context_hash": 4945466595076540074,
      "translation": "패키지가 수행하는 작업에 대한 한 줄 요약입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 11328950138328719764,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Description (optional)",
      "source_hash": 13197608734762524467,
      "context_hash": 3711185130685206266,
      "translation": "Description (선택)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A longer description of the package that can run to several paragraphs.",
      "source_hash": 13084969790664319165,
      "context_hash": 10883250371878116394,
      "translation": "여러 문단에 걸칠 수 있는 패키지에 대한 더 긴 설명입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Software that deals with metadata should not assume any maximum size for this field, though people shouldn't include their instruction manual as the description.",
      "source_hash": 2588304498570011997,
      "context_hash": 12639205959192698701,
      "translation": "메타데이터를 다루는 소프트웨어는 이 필드에 대해 어떠한 최대 크기도 가정해서는 안 되지만, 사람들은 설명으로 사용 설명서 전체를 포함해서는 안 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751560Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The contents of this field can be written using reStructuredText markup [1]_.",
      "source_hash": 18358751015345460284,
      "context_hash": 10409483824393425744,
      "translation": "이 필드의 내용은 reStructuredText 마크업 [1]_\\ 을 사용하여 작성될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751561Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "For programs that work with the metadata, supporting markup is optional; programs can also display the contents of the field as-is.",
      "source_hash": 1520376824067662304,
      "context_hash": 9832878200067188469,
      "translation": "메타데이터를 다루는 프로그램의 경우, 마크업 지원은 선택 사항입니다. 프로그램은 필드의 내용을 있는 그대로 표시할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751561Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "This means that authors should be conservative in the markup they use.",
      "source_hash": 17447428313498350408,
      "context_hash": 5659914766786111796,
      "translation": "이는 작성자가 사용하는 마크업에 있어 보수적이어야 함을 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751562Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 17302871761089630033,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751562Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Keywords (optional)",
      "source_hash": 6842684130894582344,
      "context_hash": 2981764443307984501,
      "translation": "Keywords (선택)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:01.751562Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A list of additional keywords to be used to assist searching for the package in a larger catalog.",
      "source_hash": 471457679325639513,
      "context_hash": 10739890973826967134,
      "translation": "더 큰 카탈로그에서 패키지 검색을 돕기 위해 사용될 추가 키워드 목록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036884Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 15858616723889067155,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036886Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Home-page (optional)",
      "source_hash": 965275485764932668,
      "context_hash": 6381146031918500752,
      "translation": "Home-page (선택 사항)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036886Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the URL for the package's home page.",
      "source_hash": 12966032169709914936,
      "context_hash": 8374778977500019428,
      "translation": "패키지의 홈페이지 URL을 담고 있는 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036887Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 13917806793130402227,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036887Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Download-URL",
      "source_hash": 16309209054205361718,
      "context_hash": 12093958171834971004,
      "translation": "Download-URL",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036887Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the URL from which this version of the package can be downloaded.  (This means that the URL can't be something like \".../package-latest.tgz\", but instead must be \"../package-0.45.tgz\".)",
      "source_hash": 11774267222765681608,
      "context_hash": 10247857498223002238,
      "translation": "이 버전의 패키지를 다운로드할 수 있는 URL을 담고 있는 문자열입니다. (즉, URL은 \".../package-latest.tgz\"와 같은 형태일 수 없으며, 대신 \"../package-0.45.tgz\"와 같은 형태여야 합니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036887Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Author (optional)",
      "source_hash": 6283841809443455609,
      "context_hash": 2417957175340881460,
      "translation": "Author (선택 사항)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the author's name at a minimum; additional contact information may be provided.",
      "source_hash": 12065479893807093155,
      "context_hash": 15233046328420912333,
      "translation": "최소한 저자의 이름을 담고 있는 문자열이며, 추가적인 연락처 정보가 제공될 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 12426080350385979418,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Author-email",
      "source_hash": 13977117840397741417,
      "context_hash": 6865734556285038390,
      "translation": "Author-email",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the author's e-mail address.",
      "source_hash": 13856757529282767219,
      "context_hash": 1426634495180648898,
      "translation": "저자의 이메일 주소를 담고 있는 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It can contain a name and e-mail address in the legal forms for a :rfc:`822` 'From:' header.",
      "source_hash": 3890972378984141112,
      "context_hash": 242484570402670605,
      "translation": "여기에는 이름과 이메일 주소가 :rfc:`822`\\ 의 'From:' 헤더에서 허용되는 형식으로 포함될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "It's not optional because cataloging systems can use the e-mail portion of this field as a unique key representing the author.",
      "source_hash": 5355057847075027332,
      "context_hash": 7470425530861400855,
      "translation": "카탈로그 시스템이 이 필드의 이메일 부분을 저자를 나타내는 고유 키로 사용할 수 있기 때문에, 이 필드는 선택 사항이 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "A catalog might provide authors the ability to store their GPG key, personal home page, and other additional metadata *about the author*, and optionally the ability to associate several e-mail addresses with the same person.",
      "source_hash": 14376488732906891874,
      "context_hash": 9715525106518575494,
      "translation": "카탈로그는 저자에게 자신의 GPG 키, 개인 홈페이지, 그리고 *저자에 관한* 그 밖의 추가 메타데이터를 저장할 수 있는 기능을 제공할 수 있으며, 선택적으로 동일 인물에 여러 이메일 주소를 연결할 수 있는 기능도 제공할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:4",
      "source": "Author-related metadata fields are not covered by this PEP.",
      "source_hash": 8444892709501467342,
      "context_hash": 1683055752456561722,
      "translation": "저자 관련 메타데이터 필드는 이 PEP\\ 에서 다루지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:03.036889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 8760860374019515193,
      "translation": "예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718067Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "License",
      "source_hash": 7744803634010242306,
      "context_hash": 10269775565531212875,
      "translation": "라이선스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718071Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Text indicating the license covering the package where the license is not a selection from the \"License\" Trove classifiers.",
      "source_hash": 13959671581182145975,
      "context_hash": 8135855066054418527,
      "translation": "라이선스가 \"License\" Trove 분류자 중에서 선택된 것이 아닌 경우, 패키지를 포괄하는 라이선스를 나타내는 텍스트입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "See \"Classifier\" below.",
      "source_hash": 17127046196101913533,
      "context_hash": 771284242968958778,
      "translation": "아래의 \"Classifier\"를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 5656341996353345435,
      "translation": "예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Classifier (multiple use)",
      "source_hash": 17788749630955563592,
      "context_hash": 755452130308142557,
      "translation": "Classifier (다중 사용 가능)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each entry is a string giving a single classification value for the package.",
      "source_hash": 14755098217972229039,
      "context_hash": 5195264360077202639,
      "translation": "각 항목은 패키지에 대한 단일 분류 값을 나타내는 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Classifiers are described in :pep:`301`.",
      "source_hash": 5857199937999970796,
      "context_hash": 14977625479332424229,
      "translation": "분류자는 :pep:`301`\\ 에 설명되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples",
      "source_hash": 2926230321239078022,
      "context_hash": 14191787826058865009,
      "translation": "예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Requires (multiple use)",
      "source_hash": 11295372232762352209,
      "context_hash": 15030454588043349076,
      "translation": "Requires (다중 사용 가능)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each entry contains a string describing some other module or package required by this package.",
      "source_hash": 7549844956686288524,
      "context_hash": 6854702031575820249,
      "translation": "각 항목은 이 패키지가 필요로 하는 다른 모듈이나 패키지를 설명하는 문자열을 포함합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718076Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The format of a requirement string is identical to that of a module or package name usable with the 'import' statement, optionally followed by a version declaration within parentheses.",
      "source_hash": 15940560843449203982,
      "context_hash": 1380434568987196069,
      "translation": "요구 사항 문자열의 형식은 'import' 문에 사용할 수 있는 모듈이나 패키지 이름과 동일하며, 뒤에 괄호로 묶인 버전 선언이 선택적으로 붙을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718076Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A version declaration is a series of conditional operators and version numbers, separated by commas.",
      "source_hash": 13538224374338944176,
      "context_hash": 15271530927125790097,
      "translation": "버전 선언은 쉼표로 구분된 조건 연산자와 버전 번호의 나열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718076Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Conditional operators must be one of \"<\", \">\", \"<=\", \">=\", \"==\", and \"!=\".",
      "source_hash": 834332099338690323,
      "context_hash": 1602073906415650670,
      "translation": "조건 연산자는 \"<\", \">\", \"<=\", \">=\", \"==\", \"!=\" 중 하나여야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718077Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Version numbers must be in the format accepted by the distutils.version.StrictVersion class: two or three dot-separated numeric components, with an optional \"pre-release\" tag on the end consisting of the letter 'a' or 'b' followed by a number.",
      "source_hash": 3396308777887193394,
      "context_hash": 17660520934620233672,
      "translation": "버전 번호는 distutils.version.StrictVersion 클래스가 받아들이는 형식이어야 합니다. 즉, 점으로 구분된 두세 개의 숫자 구성 요소로 이루어지며, 끝에 문자 'a' 또는 'b' 뒤에 숫자가 오는 형태의 \"pre-release\" 태그를 선택적으로 붙일 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718078Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "Example version numbers are \"1.0\", \"2.3a2\", \"1.3.99\",",
      "source_hash": 13526856080849389688,
      "context_hash": 11135113043236025277,
      "translation": "버전 번호의 예로는 \"1.0\", \"2.3a2\", \"1.3.99\" 등이 있습니다,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:21:59.718078Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Any number of conditional operators can be specified, e.g. the string \">1.0, !=1.3.4, <2.0\" is a legal version declaration.",
      "source_hash": 9371770145420871012,
      "context_hash": 4982728051252737229,
      "translation": "조건 연산자는 몇 개든 지정할 수 있으며, 예를 들어 \">1.0, !=1.3.4, <2.0\"이라는 문자열은 유효한 버전 선언입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113437Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "All of the following are possible requirement strings: \"rfc822\", \"zlib (>=1.1.4)\", \"zope\".",
      "source_hash": 17071549711495039148,
      "context_hash": 6689144988328280469,
      "translation": "다음은 모두 가능한 요구사항 문자열입니다: \"rfc822\", \"zlib (>=1.1.4)\", \"zope\".",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113443Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "There's no canonical list of what strings should be used; the Python community is left to choose its own standards.",
      "source_hash": 5653733779703466681,
      "context_hash": 13264631406223773500,
      "translation": "어떤 문자열을 사용해야 하는지에 대한 표준 목록은 존재하지 않으며, Python 커뮤니티가 자체적으로 표준을 정하도록 남겨져 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113445Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 15866375379862290533,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:19/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Provides (multiple use)",
      "source_hash": 70849089788031393,
      "context_hash": 15619170554571139855,
      "translation": "Provides (다중 사용)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:19/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each entry contains a string describing a package or module that will be provided by this package once it is installed.",
      "source_hash": 16094408810398789144,
      "context_hash": 10591339065619157479,
      "translation": "각 항목에는 이 패키지가 설치되면 함께 제공될 패키지나 모듈을 설명하는 문자열이 포함됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:19/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These strings should match the ones used in Requirements fields.",
      "source_hash": 16687394412952659922,
      "context_hash": 9519147349854977596,
      "translation": "이 문자열은 Requirements 필드에서 사용되는 것과 일치해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:19/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "A version declaration may be supplied (without a comparison operator); the package's version number will be implied if none is specified.",
      "source_hash": 7904106902179469941,
      "context_hash": 13996689551858292550,
      "translation": "버전 선언을 (비교 연산자 없이) 제공할 수 있으며, 지정하지 않으면 패키지의 버전 번호가 암묵적으로 적용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:19/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 12071015670746269096,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:20/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Obsoletes (multiple use)",
      "source_hash": 5137502077480987868,
      "context_hash": 466464099774725125,
      "translation": "Obsoletes (다중 사용)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:20/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each entry contains a string describing a package or module that this package renders obsolete, meaning that the two packages should not be installed at the same time.",
      "source_hash": 6515545748361317499,
      "context_hash": 9152998423728350701,
      "translation": "각 항목에는 이 패키지가 구식으로 만드는 패키지나 모듈을 설명하는 문자열이 포함되며, 이는 두 패키지를 동시에 설치해서는 안 된다는 것을 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113451Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:20/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Version declarations can be supplied.",
      "source_hash": 6630688681822679501,
      "context_hash": 14526816572423351347,
      "translation": "버전 선언을 제공할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113452Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:20/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The most common use of this field will be in case a package name changes, e.g. Gorgon 2.3 gets subsumed into Torqued Python 1.0.",
      "source_hash": 2704039317800285587,
      "context_hash": 15922131548792460415,
      "translation": "이 필드가 가장 흔히 사용되는 경우는 패키지 이름이 바뀌는 경우입니다. 예를 들어 Gorgon 2.3이 Torqued Python 1.0에 흡수되는 경우입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:20/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "When you install Torqued Python, the Gorgon package should be removed.",
      "source_hash": 9029322439271814105,
      "context_hash": 12374835156721218707,
      "translation": "Torqued Python을 설치하면 Gorgon 패키지는 제거되어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:20/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 6981813442998988717,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113455Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:21/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Summary of Differences From PEP 241",
      "source_hash": 3849312210066631869,
      "context_hash": 5613151498159793548,
      "translation": "PEP 241과의 차이점 요약",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:22:00.113455Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:21/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Metadata-Version is now 1.1.",
      "source_hash": 140135574627693265,
      "context_hash": 3631286668942569992,
      "translation": "Metadata-Version은 이제 1.1입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
